  - `public IntermediateState getState()` (shared field(s): externs, externsRoot, inputs, jsRoot, modules)
      doc: Returns the current internal state, excluding the input files and modules.
  - `public void setState(IntermediateState state)` (shared field(s): externs, externsRoot, inputs, jsRoot, modules)
      doc: Sets the internal state to the capture given.  Note that this assumes that the input files are already set up.
  - `public void initModules(List<T> externs, List<JSModule> modules, CompilerOptions options)` (shared field(s): externs, inputs, moduleGraph, modules)
      doc: Initializes the instance state needed for a compile job if the sources are in modules.
  - `public void check()` (shared field(s): externsRoot, jsRoot, tracker)
  - `public void optimize()` (shared field(s): externsRoot, jsRoot, tracker)

